cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying article."
title: "TCGA Expression Explorer"
abstract: >-
  A static web tool that shows the expression of one gene, in one TCGA cohort, under all three
  generations of TCGA gene-level RNA-seq quantification side by side, on the same specimens,
  optionally split by published molecular-subtype schemes.
